2. ऊह् cl. 1. P. Ā. ऊहति, -ते (Ved. ओहते), ऊहां-चकार, &c. (by native authorities not distinguished from 1. ऊह् above), to observe, mark, note, attend to, heed, regard, RV.; AV. xx, 131, 10;
to expect, hope for, wait for, listen for, RV.;
to comprehend, conceive, conjecture, guess, suppose, infer, reason, deliberate upon, MBh.; BhP.; Nyāyam.; Bhaṭṭ. &c.:
Caus. ऊहयति (aor. औजिहत्), to consider, heed, MBh.;
to cause to suppose or infer, Bhaṭṭ.
